    <briefdescription>
<para>When writing a profile with size limit, user may want to use a different strategy to reduce function count other than dropping functions with fewest samples first. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>In this case a class implementing the same interfaces should be provided to <ref refid="classllvm_1_1sampleprof_1_1_sample_profile_writer_1a9283506633cf544e4a6163c0133fc769" kindref="member">SampleProfileWriter::writeWithSizeLimit()</ref>. </para>
